OL,3,GNEWSAAutumn river levels could move
OL,4,Anurdles downstream
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh river flows this autumn could
OL,7,Fflush 2.2 tonnes of microplastics
OL,8,Fdownstream, scientists have warned.
OL,10,FTonnes of the pellets, known as
OL,11,Fnurdles, were spilled into the River
OL,12,FTyne after a crash between two vessels
OL,13,Fat the Port of Tyne damaged two
OL,14,Fshipping containers.
OL,16,FAccording to new modelling from
OL,17,FNewcastle University, about one in
OL,18,Feight of the nurdles remained in the
OL,19,Festuary six weeks after the spill.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
