OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1791899794
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAutumn river levels could move
OL,4,Anurdles downstream
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scientists have urged the
OL,7,Fauthorities involved in the clean-up
OL,8,Foperation to use measures to intercept,
OL,9,Ftrap or recover the nurdles before they
OL,10,Fmove towards the North Sea.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
